      "text": {
        "hi": "कुछ ढूँढ रहे हो? पूछो: Where is …? = … कहाँ है?",
        "hinglish": "Kuch dhoondh rahe ho? Poochho: Where is …? = … kahan hai?",
        "en": "Looking for something? Ask: Where is …?"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "learn_card",
      "id": "L3.U10.S02",
      "skills": [
        "grammar.where_prepositions"
      ],
      "text": {
        "hi": "हिंदी में ‘में, पर, नीचे’ बाद में आते हैं: बैग में। इंग्लिश में पहले: in the bag, on the table, under the bed.",
        "hinglish": "Hindi mein ‘mein, par, neeche’ baad mein aate hain: bag mein. English mein pehle: in the bag, on the table, under the bed.",
        "en": "In Hindi, ‘mein, par, neeche’ come after the word. In English, they come before: in the bag, on the table, under the bed."
      }
    },
